ies tiled vector data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in ","type":"text"},{"text":"Mapbox Vector Tile","type":"text"},{"text":" format","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A vector tile source is added to an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object along with one or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source.","type":"text"}],"title":"MLNVectorTileSource","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/FeatureStateVectorExample":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestatevectorexample","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample","title":"Set Feature State (Vector Source)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This example demonstrates feature state on a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", toggling the appearance of countries in a vector tileset as they are tapped."}],"role":"article